<title>UK: Environmental group warns against Chad oil project.</title>
<headline>Environmental group warns against Chad oil project.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental campaign group Friends of the Earth warned on Wednesday that oil development in the Doba region of the central African state of Chad risked reigniting social unrest in the area.</p>
<p>&quot;A potential environmental and social disaster is planned for central Africa,&quot; said Friends of the Earth campaigns director Tony Juniper. The group also warned that the project could cause environmental damage to ecologically sensitive areas.</p>
</text>
